{
  "area": "tools",
  "description": "fsGuard.resolveWithin decisions. Input: tree (files, dirs, links; {base} is a fresh temp folder the runner creates), roots (folders), requested (path text), options ({mustExist, createParents}), protected (Draggy storage). Expected: {ok: true, path} or {ok: false, error}. Paths in expected use {base}. Each case is independent. A dangling link (a link whose target is missing) is refused when it is the requested path. A dangling link in the middle of a path is kept inside the folder, and the write it allows cannot create anything outside it.",
